# Build context hygiene — without this the whole node_modules tree (~500 MB)
# is uploaded to the daemon on every build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
.github
.husky
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
coverage
**/coverage
.DS_Store
observability
postgres
docker-compose*.yml
**/stress-tests
